                                size: 16, color: Color(0xFF4FC3F7)),
                            label: Text(provider.t('dev.coupon.create'),
                                style:
                                    const TextStyle(color: Color(0xFF4FC3F7))),
                            onPressed: () {
                              Navigator.pop(dctx);
                              _showCouponManagerDialog(ctx, provider);
                            },
                          ),
                        ),

                        const SizedBox(height: 20),

                        // ── プラン別ユーザー一覧 ──
                        // /users コレクションを取得し、free / pro / coupon の
                        // 内訳と各ユーザーの詳細をダイアログで表示する。
                        _devSection(provider.t('dev.users.title'),
                            Icons.group_rounded, const Color(0xFF9CCC65)),
                        const SizedBox(height: 8),
                        SizedBox(
                          width: double.infinity,
                          child: ElevatedButton.icon(
                            style: ElevatedButton.styleFrom(
                                backgroundColor: const Color(0xFF1A2A14),
                                foregroundColor: Colors.white,
                                side: const BorderSide(
                                    color: Color(0xFF9CCC65), width: 1),
                                padding:
                                    const EdgeInsets.symmetric(vertical: 10)),
                            icon: const Icon(Icons.group_rounded,
                                size: 16, color: Color(0xFF9CCC65)),
                            label: Text(provider.t('dev.users.title'),
                                style:
                                    const TextStyle(color: Color(0xFF9CCC65))),
                            onPressed: () {
                              Navigator.pop(dctx);
                              _showUsersByPlanDialog(ctx, provider);
                            },
                          ),
                        ),

                        const SizedBox(height: 20),

                        // ── 利用者の属性 (= ユーザー要望: Google アカウントの
                        //    年齢 / 性別 / 国を分析に使いたい) ──
                        _devSection(provider.t('analytics.title'),
                            Icons.insights_rounded, const Color(0xFFBA68C8)),
                        const SizedBox(height: 8),
                        SizedBox(
                          width: double.infinity,
                          child: ElevatedButton.icon(
                            style: ElevatedButton.styleFrom(
                                backgroundColor: const Color(0xFF241A2E),
                                foregroundColor: Colors.white,
                                side: const BorderSide(
                                    color: Color(0xFFBA68C8), width: 1),
                                padding:
                                    const EdgeInsets.symmetric(vertical: 10)),
                            icon: const Icon(Icons.insights_rounded,
                                size: 16, color: Color(0xFFBA68C8)),
                            label: Text(provider.t('analytics.title'),
                                style:
                                    const TextStyle(color: Color(0xFFBA68C8))),
                            onPressed: () {
                              Navigator.pop(dctx);
                              _showAnalyticsProfileDialog(ctx, provider);
                            },
                          ),
                        ),

                        const SizedBox(height: 20),

                        // ── 問い合わせ受信箱 ──
                        _devSection('問い合わせ受信箱', Icons.inbox_rounded,
                            const Color(0xFFFFB347)),
                        const SizedBox(height: 8),
                        SizedBox(
                          width: double.infinity,
                          child: ElevatedButton.icon(
                            style: ElevatedButton.styleFrom(
                                backgroundColor: const Color(0xFF1A1A0D),
                                foregroundColor: Colors.white,
                                side: const BorderSide(
                                    color: Color(0xFFFFB347), width: 1),
                                padding:
                                    const EdgeInsets.symmetric(vertical: 10)),
                            icon: const Icon(Icons.mail_rounded,
                                size: 16, color: Color(0xFFFFB347)),
                            label: Text(provider.t('dev.openInbox'),
                                style: TextStyle(color: Color(0xFFFFB347))),
                            onPressed: () {
                              Navigator.pop(dctx);
                              showDialog(
                                context: ctx,
                                builder: (_) =>
                                    _DevInboxDialog(provider: provider),
                              );
                            },
                          ),
                        ),
                        // ── 開発者モードを解除 (ログアウト) ──
                        // 一度入った開発者モードは SharedPreferences で永続化されて
                        // いるため、再起動しても維持される。明示的にこのボタンを
                        // 押すまで解除されない。誤タップ防止のため確認ダイアログを
                        // はさむ。
                        const SizedBox(height: 24),
                        const Divider(color: Color(0xFF333333), height: 1),
                        const SizedBox(height: 16),
                        _devSection('開発者モードを終了', Icons.logout_rounded,
                            const Color(0xFFE57373)),
                        const SizedBox(height: 8),
                        SizedBox(
                          width: double.infinity,
                          child: ElevatedButton.icon(
                            style: ElevatedButton.styleFrom(
                                backgroundColor: const Color(0xFF2A0D0D),
                                foregroundColor: Colors.white,
                                side: const BorderSide(
                                    color: Color(0xFFE57373), width: 1),
                                padding:
                                    const EdgeInsets.symmetric(vertical: 10)),
                            icon: const Icon(Icons.logout_rounded,
                                size: 16, color: Color(0xFFE57373)),
                            label: Text(provider.t('dev.logout'),
                                style: const TextStyle(
                                    color: Color(0xFFE57373),
                                    fontWeight: FontWeight.w700)),
                            onPressed: () async {
                              // 確認ダイアログ
                              final ok = await showDialog<bool>(
                                context: ctx,
                                builder: (cdctx) => AlertDialog(
                                  backgroundColor: const Color(0xFF1E1E1E),
                                  shape: RoundedRectangleBorder(
                                      borderRadius: BorderRadius.circular(14)),
                                  title: Text(provider.t('dev.logoutTitle'),
                                      style: const TextStyle(
                                          color: Colors.white, fontSize: 16)),
                                  content: Text(provider.t('dev.logoutBody'),
                                      style: const TextStyle(
                                          color: Colors.white70, fontSize: 13)),
                                  actions: [
                                    TextButton(
                                      onPressed: () =>
                                          Navigator.of(cdctx).pop(false),
                                      child: Text(provider.t('btn.cancel'),
                                          style: const TextStyle(
                                              color: Colors.white60)),
                                    ),
                                    TextButton(
                                      onPressed: () =>
                                          Navigator.of(cdctx).pop(true),
                                      child: Text(provider.t('dev.disableBtn'),
                                          style: const TextStyle(
                                              color: Color(0xFFE57373),
                                              fontWeight: FontWeight.w700)),
                                    ),
                                  ],
                                ),
                              );
                              if (ok == true) {
                                final deactivation =
                                    provider.deactivateDeveloperMode();
                                if (dctx.mounted) Navigator.of(dctx).pop();
                                await deactivation;
                              }
                            },
                          ),
                        ),
                      ]),
                ),
              ),
            );
          },
        );

    final rootNavigator = Navigator.of(ctx, rootNavigator: true);
    late final Route<void> developerRoute;
    if (_isDesktop) {
      developerRoute = DialogRoute<void>(
        context: ctx,
        barrierDismissible: false,
        builder: buildDeveloperContent,
      );
    } else {
      // Android/iOS は WebView が背後にある状態でダイアログを重ねると
      // タップを奪われるため、不透明な全画面ルートに載せる。
      developerRoute = MaterialPageRoute<void>(
        fullscreenDialog: true,
        builder: (routeCtx) => Scaffold(
          backgroundColor: const Color(0xFF0D0D1A),
          body: SafeArea(
            child: Center(child: buildDeveloperContent(routeCtx)),
          ),
        ),
      );
    }

    var closingRevokedRoute = false;
    void closeIfDeveloperModeWasRevoked() {
      if (provider.developerMode || closingRevokedRoute) return;
      closingRevokedRoute = true;
      WidgetsBinding.instance.addPostFrameCallback((_) {
        final navigator = developerRoute.navigator;
        if (developerRoute.isActive && navigator != null) {
          navigator.removeRoute(developerRoute);
        }
      });
    }

    provider.addListener(closeIfDeveloperModeWasRevoked);
    final developerFuture = rootNavigator.push(developerRoute);
    unawaited(developerFuture.whenComplete(() {
      provider.removeListener(closeIfDeveloperModeWasRevoked);
      emailCtrl.dispose();
    }));
  }

  Widget _devSection(String title, IconData icon, Color color) {
    return Row(children: [
      Icon(icon, color: color, size: 16),
      const SizedBox(width: 6),
      Text(title,
          style: TextStyle(
              color: color, fontSize: 13, fontWeight: FontWeight.w600)),
    ]);
  }

  /// 開発者モード: プラン別ユーザー一覧ダイアログ
  /// /users コレクションを一覧取得し、free / pro / coupon の集計と
  /// 各ユーザー詳細をスクロール可能なリストで表示する。
  void _showUsersByPlanDialog(BuildContext ctx, MindMapProvider provider) {
    final uidSearchCtrl = TextEditingController();
    List<Map<String, dynamic>>? users;
    bool loading = true;
    bool firstLoadKicked = false;
    Map<String, dynamic>? searchedUser;
    bool searching = false;
    String? searchError;

    showDialog<void>(
      context: ctx,
      builder: (dctx) => StatefulBuilder(
        builder: (sctx, setD) {
          Future<void> reload() async {
            setD(() {
              loading = true;
              users = null;
            });
            final list = await provider.listAllUsers();
            if (!sctx.mounted) return;
            setD(() {
              users = list;
              loading = false;
            });
          }

          if (!firstLoadKicked) {
            firstLoadKicked = true;
            // 初回のみ自動でロード
            // ignore: discarded_futures
            Future.microtask(reload);
          }

          Future<void> searchByUid() async {
            final uid = uidSearchCtrl.text.trim();
            if (uid.isEmpty) {
              setD(() {
                searchedUser = null;
                searchError = 'UID を入力してください';
              });
              return;
            }
            setD(() {
              searching = true;
              searchedUser = null;
              searchError = null;
            });
            final found = await provider.fetchUserLicenseByUid(uid);
            if (!sctx.mounted) return;
            setD(() {
              searching = false;
              searchedUser = found;
              searchError = found == null ? 'UID が見つかりません' : null;
            });
          }

          // プラン別カウント
          int freeCount = 0, proCount = 0, maxCount = 0, couponCount = 0;
          if (users != null) {
            for (final u in users!) {
              final plan = (u['plan'] as String?) ?? 'free';
              if (plan == 'pro') {
                proCount++;
              } else if (plan == 'max') {
                maxCount++;
              } else if (plan == 'coupon') {
                couponCount++;
              } else {
                freeCount++;
              }
            }
          }

          Color planColor(String plan) {
            switch (plan) {
              case 'pro':
                return const Color(0xFFFFB347);
              case 'max':
                return const Color(0xFFE91E63);
              case 'coupon':
                return const Color(0xFF4FC3F7);
              case 'developer':
                return const Color(0xFFBA68C8);
              default:
                return const Color(0xFF9CCC65);
            }
          }

          String planLabel(String plan) {
            switch (plan) {
              case 'pro':
                return provider.t('dev.users.planPro');
              case 'max':
                return 'Max';
              case 'coupon':
                return provider.t('dev.users.planCoupon');
              case 'developer':
                return 'Developer';
              default:
                return provider.t('dev.users.planFree');
            }
          }

          Widget detailLine(String label, String value) {
            if (value.isEmpty) return const SizedBox.shrink();
            return Padding(
              padding: const EdgeInsets.only(top: 3),
              child: SelectableText(
                '$label: $value',
                style: const TextStyle(color: Colors.white54, fontSize: 10),
              ),
            );
          }

          Widget licenseCard(Map<String, dynamic> u) {
            final plan = (u['plan'] as String?) ?? 'free';
            final uid = (u['uid'] as String?) ?? '';
            final name = (u['displayName'] as String?) ?? '';
            return Container(
              margin: const EdgeInsets.only(top: 8),
              padding: const EdgeInsets.all(10),
              decoration: BoxDecoration(
                color: Colors.white.withValues(alpha: 0.04),
                borderRadius: BorderRadius.circular(10),
                border:
                    Border.all(color: planColor(plan).withValues(alpha: 0.5)),
              ),
              child: Column(
                crossAxisAlignment: CrossAxisAlignment.start,
                children: [
                  Row(children: [
                    Expanded(
                      child: Text(
                        name.isEmpty ? '(no name)' : name,
                        style: const TextStyle(
                            color: Colors.white,
                            fontSize: 13,
                            fontWeight: FontWeight.w700),
                        overflow: TextOverflow.ellipsis,
                      ),
                    ),
                    _couponBadge(planLabel(plan), planColor(plan)),
                  ]),
                  SelectableText(
                    'UID: ${uid.isEmpty ? '-' : uid}',
                    style: const TextStyle(
                        color: Colors.white38,
                        fontSize: 10,
                        fontFamily: 'monospace'),
                  ),
                  detailLine(
                      'status', (u['subscriptionStatus'] as String?) ?? ''),
                  detailLine('source', (u['planSource'] as String?) ?? ''),
                  detailLine('expires', (u['planExpiresAt'] as String?) ?? ''),
                  detailLine('updated', (u['planUpdatedAt'] as String?) ?? ''),
                  detailLine('coupon', (u['couponCode'] as String?) ?? ''),
                  // ── 属性 (= ユーザー要望: 年齢 / 性別 / 国を分析に) ──
                  //    未取得は 0 で入るので、 空欄として扱う。
                  detailLine(
                      'age',
                      ((u['ageYears'] as String?) ?? '') == '0'
                          ? ''
                          : ((u['ageYears'] as String?) ?? '')),
                  detailLine('gender', (u['gender'] as String?) ?? ''),
                  detailLine('country', (u['country'] as String?) ?? ''),
                  detailLine('locale', (u['locale'] as String?) ?? ''),
                  detailLine('lastSeen', (u['lastSeen'] as String?) ?? ''),
                ],
              ),
            );
          }

          return AlertDialog(
            backgroundColor: const Color(0xFF1E1E1E),
            shape:
                RoundedRectangleBorder(borderRadius: BorderRadius.circular(14)),
            title: Row(children: [
              const Icon(Icons.group_rounded,
                  color: Color(0xFF9CCC65), size: 22),
              const SizedBox(width: 8),
              Expanded(
                child: Text(provider.t('dev.users.title'),
                    style: const TextStyle(
                        color: Colors.white,
                        fontSize: 16,
                        fontWeight: FontWeight.w700)),
              ),
              IconButton(
                tooltip: provider.t('dev.users.refresh'),
                icon: const Icon(Icons.refresh_rounded,
                    color: Colors.white70, size: 20),
                onPressed: loading ? null : reload,
              ),
            ]),
            content: SizedBox(
              width: 460,
              height: 500,
              child: Column(
                crossAxisAlignment: CrossAxisAlignment.stretch,
                children: [
                  // 集計バッジ
                  if (users != null)
                    Wrap(
                      spacing: 8,
                      runSpacing: 6,
                      children: [
                        _planBadge(
                            planLabel('free'), freeCount, planColor('free')),
                        _planBadge(
                            planLabel('pro'), proCount, planColor('pro')),
                        _planBadge(
                            planLabel('max'), maxCount, planColor('max')),
                        _planBadge(planLabel('coupon'), couponCount,
                            planColor('coupon')),
                      ],
                    ),
                  const SizedBox(height: 12),
                  Container(
                    padding: const EdgeInsets.all(10),
                    decoration: BoxDecoration(
                      color: const Color(0xFF101820),
                      borderRadius: BorderRadius.circular(10),
                      border: Border.all(color: Colors.white12),
                    ),
                    child: Column(
                      crossAxisAlignment: CrossAxisAlignment.stretch,
                      children: [
                        Row(children: [
                          Expanded(
                            child: TextField(
                              controller: uidSearchCtrl,
                              style: const TextStyle(
                                  color: Colors.white, fontSize: 12),
                              decoration: InputDecoration(
                                isDense: true,
                                hintText: context.read<MindMapProvider>().t('dev.uidSearchHint'),
                                hintStyle: const TextStyle(
                                    color: Colors.white38, fontSize: 12),
                                filled: true,
                                fillColor: Colors.white.withValues(alpha: 0.05),
                                border: OutlineInputBorder(
                                  borderRadius: BorderRadius.circular(8),
                                  borderSide: BorderSide.none,
                                ),
                                contentPadding: const EdgeInsets.symmetric(
                                    horizontal: 10, vertical: 9),
                              ),
                              onSubmitted: (_) => searchByUid(),
                            ),
                          ),
                          const SizedBox(width: 8),
                          ElevatedButton.icon(
                            style: ElevatedButton.styleFrom(
                              backgroundColor: const Color(0xFF9CCC65),
                              foregroundColor: Colors.black87,
                              padding: const EdgeInsets.symmetric(
                                  horizontal: 10, vertical: 10),
                            ),
                            onPressed: searching ? null : searchByUid,
                            icon: searching
                                ? const SizedBox(
                                    width: 12,
                                    height: 12,
                                    child: CircularProgressIndicator(
                                        strokeWidth: 2, color: Colors.black87),
                                  )
                                : const Icon(Icons.search_rounded, size: 16),
                            label: Text(context.read<MindMapProvider>().t('btn.search')),
                          ),
                        ]),
                        if (searchError != null) ...[
                          const SizedBox(height: 6),
                          Text(searchError!,
                              style: const TextStyle(
                                  color: Color(0xFFFF6B6B), fontSize: 11)),
                        ],
                        if (searchedUser != null) licenseCard(searchedUser!),
                      ],
                    ),
                  ),
                  const SizedBox(height: 12),
                  Expanded(
                    child: loading
                        ? const Center(
                            child: CircularProgressIndicator(
                                color: Color(0xFF9CCC65)))
                        : (users == null || users!.isEmpty)
                            ? Center(
                                child: Text(provider.t('dev.users.empty'),
                                    style: const TextStyle(
                                        color: Colors.white54, fontSize: 13)))
                            : ListView.separated(
                                itemCount: users!.length,
                                separatorBuilder: (_, __) => const Divider(
                                    color: Color(0xFF333333), height: 1),
                                itemBuilder: (_, i) {
                                  final u = users![i];
                                  final plan = (u['plan'] as String?) ?? 'free';
                                  final uid = (u['uid'] as String?) ?? '';
                                  final name =
                                      (u['displayName'] as String?) ?? '';
                                  final lastSeen =
                                      (u['lastSeen'] as String?) ?? '';
                                  final coupon =
                                      (u['couponCode'] as String?) ?? '';
                                  return ListTile(
                                    dense: true,
                                    contentPadding: const EdgeInsets.symmetric(
                                        horizontal: 4),
                                    leading: Container(
                                      width: 8,
                                      height: 32,
                                      decoration: BoxDecoration(
                                          color: planColor(plan),
                                          borderRadius:
                                              BorderRadius.circular(2)),
                                    ),
                                    title: Text(
                                      name.isEmpty
                                          ? '(no name)  /  $uid'
                                          : '$name  /  $uid',
                                      style: const TextStyle(
                                          color: Colors.white,
                                          fontSize: 13,
                                          fontWeight: FontWeight.w600),
                                      overflow: TextOverflow.ellipsis,
                                    ),
                                    subtitle: Column(
                                      crossAxisAlignment:
                                          CrossAxisAlignment.start,
                                      children: [
                                        Text(uid,
                                            style: const TextStyle(
                                                color: Colors.white38,
                                                fontSize: 10,
                                                fontFamily: 'monospace'),
                                            overflow: TextOverflow.ellipsis),
                                        Text(
                                            '${provider.t('dev.users.lastSeen')}: '
                                            '${lastSeen.isEmpty ? '-' : lastSeen}',
                                            style: const TextStyle(
                                                color: Colors.white54,
                                                fontSize: 10)),
                                        if (coupon.isNotEmpty)
                                          Text('coupon: $coupon',
                                              style: const TextStyle(
                                                  color: Color(0xFF4FC3F7),
                                                  fontSize: 10)),
                                      ],
                                    ),
                                    trailing: Container(
                                      padding: const EdgeInsets.symmetric(
                                          horizontal: 8, vertical: 3),
                                      decoration: BoxDecoration(
                                          color: planColor(plan)
                                              .withValues(alpha: 0.15),
                                          borderRadius:
                                              BorderRadius.circular(6),
                                          border: Border.all(
                                              color: planColor(plan),
                                              width: 1)),
                                      child: Text(planLabel(plan),
                                          style: TextStyle(
                                              color: planColor(plan),
                                              fontSize: 11,
                                              fontWeight: FontWeight.w700)),
                                    ),
                                  );
                                },
                              ),
                  ),
                ],
              ),
            ),
            actions: [
              // 「開発者モードを解除」 = 明示的にログアウトする赤ボタン。
              // 一度開発者モードに入ったら、このボタンを押すまでは閉じる/再起動でも
              // 維持される (SharedPreferences 永続化済み)。
              TextButton.icon(
                onPressed: () async {
                  // 確認ダイアログ無しで即解除。誤タップを避けるため
                  // 赤色で「解除」と明示している。
                  final deactivation = provider.deactivateDeveloperMode();
                  if (dctx.mounted) Navigator.of(dctx).pop();
                  await deactivation;
                },
                icon: const Icon(Icons.logout_rounded,
                    size: 16, color: Color(0xFFE57373)),
                label: Text(provider.t('dev.logoutTitle'),
                    style: const TextStyle(
                        color: Color(0xFFE57373), fontWeight: FontWeight.w700)),
              ),
              TextButton(
                onPressed: () => Navigator.of(dctx).pop(),
                child: Text(provider.t('btn.close'),
                    style: const TextStyle(color: Colors.white60)),
              ),
            ],
          );
        },
      ),
    ).whenComplete(uidSearchCtrl.dispose);
  }

  /// 集計バッジを構築するヘルパー
  Widget _planBadge(String label, int count, Color color) {
    return Container(
      padding: const EdgeInsets.symmetric(horizontal: 10, vertical: 5),
      decoration: BoxDecoration(
          color: color.withValues(alpha: 0.15),
          borderRadius: BorderRadius.circular(8),
          border: Border.all(color: color, width: 1)),
      child: Row(
        mainAxisSize: MainAxisSize.min,
        children: [
          Text(label,
              style: TextStyle(
                  color: color, fontSize: 11, fontWeight: FontWeight.w600)),
          const SizedBox(width: 6),
          Text('$count',
              style: TextStyle(
                  color: color, fontSize: 13, fontWeight: FontWeight.w800)),
        ],
      ),
    );
  }

  /// 開発者モード専用: この端末の利用者属性 (国 / 言語)。
  ///
  /// 国と言語はログイン情報と端末の地域設定から自動で入る。
  /// 旧「Google から取得 (生年月日 / 性別)」 は廃止 (= ユーザー要望: 自分自身の
  /// アカウント情報を取りに行っても意味が無い)。
  void _showAnalyticsProfileDialog(
      BuildContext ctx, MindMapProvider provider) {
    showDialog<void>(
      context: ctx,
      builder: (dctx) => Builder(
        builder: (sctx) {
          Widget row(String label, String value) => Padding(
                padding: const EdgeInsets.symmetric(vertical: 3),
                child: Row(crossAxisAlignment: CrossAxisAlignment.start, children: [
                  SizedBox(
                    width: 96,
                    child: Text(label,
                        style: const TextStyle(
                            color: Colors.white38, fontSize: 12)),
                  ),
                  Expanded(
                    child: SelectableText(
                      value.isEmpty ? provider.t('analytics.unknown') : value,
                      style: TextStyle(
                          color: value.isEmpty ? Colors.white38 : Colors.white,
                          fontSize: 12.5),
                    ),
                  ),
                ]),
              );

          // 旧「Google から取得 (生年月日 / 性別)」 は廃止 (= ユーザー要望:
          //   自分自身のアカウント情報を聞きに行っても意味が無い)。
          //   機密スコープ (user.birthday.read / user.gender.read) の要求ごと
          //   やめたので、 Google の OAuth 審査も不要になった。
          //   年齢 / 性別の行も書き手が無くなったので出さない。
          final updated = provider.analyticsUpdatedAt;
          return AlertDialog(
            backgroundColor: const Color(0xFF1E1E1E),
            shape:
                RoundedRectangleBorder(borderRadius: BorderRadius.circular(14)),
            title: Row(children: [
              const Icon(Icons.insights_rounded,
                  color: Color(0xFFBA68C8), size: 22),
              const SizedBox(width: 8),
              Expanded(
                child: Text(provider.t('analytics.title'),
                    style: const TextStyle(
                        color: Colors.white,
                        fontSize: 16,
                        fontWeight: FontWeight.w700)),
              ),
            ]),
            content: SizedBox(
              width: 420,
              child: SingleChildScrollView(
                child: Column(
                  mainAxisSize: MainAxisSize.min,
                  crossAxisAlignment: CrossAxisAlignment.start,
                  children: [
                    Container(
                      padding: const EdgeInsets.all(12),
                      decoration: BoxDecoration(
                        color: const Color(0xFF15151F),
                        borderRadius: BorderRadius.circular(10),
                      ),
                      child: Column(children: [
                        row(provider.t('analytics.country'),
                            provider.analyticsCountry),
                        row(provider.t('analytics.language'),
                            provider.analyticsLocale),
                        row(provider.t('analytics.source'),
                            provider.analyticsSource),
                        row('UID', provider.currentUid ?? ''),
                        row('updated',
                            updated == null
                                ? ''
                                : '${updated.year}/${updated.month.toString().padLeft(2, '0')}/'
                                    '${updated.day.toString().padLeft(2, '0')} '
                                    '${updated.hour.toString().padLeft(2, '0')}:'
                                    '${updated.minute.toString().padLeft(2, '0')}'),
                      ]),
                    ),
                    const SizedBox(height: 12),
                    Text(provider.t('analytics.note'),
                        style: const TextStyle(
                            color: Colors.white38, fontSize: 11, height: 1.6)),
                  ],
                ),
              ),
            ),
            actions: [
              TextButton(
                onPressed: () => Navigator.pop(dctx),
                child: Text(provider.t('btn.close'),
                    style: const TextStyle(color: Colors.white60)),
              ),
            ],
          );
        },
      ),
    );
  }

  /// Google アカウント (= ユーザー要望: ログインした端末の間で有料プランと
  /// クラウド使用量を共有する)。
  void _showGoogleAccountDialog(BuildContext ctx, MindMapProvider provider) {
    showDialog<void>(
      context: ctx,
      builder: (dctx) => StatefulBuilder(
        builder: (sctx, setD) {
          var busy = false;
          String? message;
          var isError = false;

          Future<void> doSignIn() async {
            if (busy) return;
            setD(() {
              busy = true;
              message = provider.t('account.openingBrowser');
              isError = false;
            });
            try {
              final who = await provider.signInWithGoogle();
              if (!sctx.mounted) return;
              setD(() {
                busy = false;
                message = who == null
                    ? provider.t('account.cancelled')
                    : provider.t('account.signedInAs')
                        .replaceFirst('{who}', who);
                isError = who == null;
              });
            } catch (e) {
              if (!sctx.mounted) return;
              setD(() {
                busy = false;
                message = '$e';
                isError = true;
              });
            }
          }

          Future<void> doSignOut() async {
            if (busy) return;
            setD(() => busy = true);
            await provider.signOutGoogle();
            if (!sctx.mounted) return;
            setD(() {
              busy = false;
              message = provider.t('account.signedOutDone');
              isError = false;
            });
          }

          return AlertDialog(
            backgroundColor: const Color(0xFF1E1E1E),
            shape:
                RoundedRectangleBorder(borderRadius: BorderRadius.circular(14)),
            title: Row(children: [
              const Icon(Icons.account_circle_rounded,
                  color: Color(0xFF4FC3F7), size: 22),
              const SizedBox(width: 8),
              Expanded(
                child: Text(provider.t('account.title'),
                    style: const TextStyle(
                        color: Colors.white,
                        fontSize: 16,
                        fontWeight: FontWeight.w700)),
              ),
            ]),
            content: SizedBox(
              width: 400,
              child: Column(
                mainAxisSize: MainAxisSize.min,
                crossAxisAlignment: CrossAxisAlignment.start,
                children: [
                  Text(provider.t('account.explain'),
                      style: const TextStyle(
                          color: Colors.white70, fontSize: 12, height: 1.6)),
                  // この配布に Google の認証情報が入っていない時は、 押しても
                  //   進めないので先に伝える。
                  if (!provider.canUseGoogleSignIn) ...[
                    const SizedBox(height: 10),
                    Text(provider.t('account.notConfigured'),
                        style: const TextStyle(
                            color: Color(0xFFFFB74D),
                            fontSize: 11.5,
                            height: 1.5)),
                  ],
                  const SizedBox(height: 14),
                  Container(
                    padding: const EdgeInsets.all(12),
                    decoration: BoxDecoration(
                      color: const Color(0xFF15151F),
                      borderRadius: BorderRadius.circular(10),
                    ),
                    child: Row(children: [
                      Icon(
                          provider.googleSignedIn
                              ? Icons.verified_user_rounded
                              : Icons.person_off_rounded,
                          size: 18,
                          color: provider.googleSignedIn
                              ? const Color(0xFF9CCC65)
                              : Colors.white38),
                      const SizedBox(width: 10),
                      Expanded(
                        child: Text(
                            provider.googleSignedIn
                                ? (provider.googleEmail.isEmpty
                                    ? provider.t('account.signedIn')
                                    : provider.googleEmail)
                                : provider.t('account.signedOut'),
                            style: const TextStyle(
                                color: Colors.white, fontSize: 12.5)),
                      ),
                    ]),
                  ),
                  // ── 利用者 ID (= UID)。 問い合わせや Dev コードの発行元
                  //    登録に使うので、 見られる / 写せるようにしておく
                  //    (= ユーザー要望: 打つのが大変)。 ──
                  const SizedBox(height: 8),
                  _uidCopyRow(provider),
                  if (message != null) ...[
                    const SizedBox(height: 12),
                    Text(message!,
                        style: TextStyle(
                            color: isError
                                ? const Color(0xFFEF9A9A)
                                : const Color(0xFF9CCC65),
                            fontSize: 11.5,
                            height: 1.5)),
                  ],
                  if (busy) ...[
                    const SizedBox(height: 12),
                    const LinearProgressIndicator(minHeight: 2),
                  ],
                ],
              ),
            ),
            actions: [
              if (provider.googleSignedIn)
                TextButton(
                  onPressed: busy ? null : doSignOut,
                  child: Text(provider.t('account.signOut'),
                      style: const TextStyle(color: Colors.white54)),
                ),
              TextButton(
                onPressed: () => Navigator.of(dctx).pop(),
                child: Text(provider.t('btn.close'),
                    style: const TextStyle(color: Colors.white54)),
              ),
              FilledButton.icon(
                onPressed:
                    (busy || !provider.canUseGoogleSignIn) ? null : doSignIn,
                icon: const Icon(Icons.login_rounded, size: 16),
                label: Text(provider.googleSignedIn
                    ? provider.t('account.switch')
                    : provider.t('account.signIn')),
              ),
            ],
          );
        },
      ),
    );
  }


  /// ライセンス引き継ぎ: リストアコード入力ダイアログ

  /// 設定画面から開く統合ライセンス引き継ぎダイアログ。
  /// 「発行」と「入力」をタブで切り替える。
  /// - 発行: 現在の Pro / クーポン状態を別端末に渡す 8 桁コードを生成
  /// - 入力: 別端末で発行したコードを入力してライセンスを受け取る
  /// 1 ライセンスにつき 4 端末まで使い回せる。


  /// 管理者：全グループのデータ閲覧・削除画面
  void _showAdminDataScreen(BuildContext ctx, MindMapProvider provider) {
    showDialog(
      context: ctx,
      barrierDismissible: false,
      builder: (dctx) => StatefulBuilder(
        builder: (sctx, setD) {
          List<Map<String, dynamic>>? groups;
          List<Map<String, dynamic>>? selectedGroupPages;
          String? selectedGroupId;
          bool loading = false;
          String? error;

          WidgetsBinding.instance.addPostFrameCallback((_) async {
            if (groups == null && !loading) {
              setD(() => loading = true);
              try {
                final result = await provider.fetchAllGroups();
                setD(() {
                  groups = result;
                  loading = false;
                });
              } catch (e) {
                setD(() {
                  error = e.toString();
                  loading = false;
                });
              }
            }
          });

          return AlertDialog(
            backgroundColor: const Color(0xFF0D0D1A),
            shape:
                RoundedRectangleBorder(borderRadius: BorderRadius.circular(16)),
            title: Row(children: [
              const Icon(Icons.admin_panel_settings_rounded,
                  color: Color(0xFFFF6B6B), size: 20),
              const SizedBox(width: 8),
              Text(provider.t('admin.dataTitle'),
                  style: const TextStyle(color: Colors.white, fontSize: 16)),
              const Spacer(),
              IconButton(
                icon: const Icon(Icons.close, color: Colors.white54, size: 20),
                onPressed: () => Navigator.pop(dctx),
              ),
            ]),
            content: SizedBox(
              width: 440,
              height: 480,
              child: loading
                  ? const Center(
                      child:
                          CircularProgressIndicator(color: Color(0xFFFF6B6B)))
                  : error != null
                      ? Center(
                          child: Text(error!,
                              style: const TextStyle(
                                  color: Colors.redAccent, fontSize: 12)))
                      : groups == null || groups!.isEmpty
                          ? Center(
                              child: Text(provider.t('admin.noGroups'),
                                  style:
                                      const TextStyle(color: Colors.white54)))
                          : Column(
                              crossAxisAlignment: CrossAxisAlignment.start,
                              children: [
                                Text(
                                    provider.t('admin.groupCount').replaceFirst(
                                        '{n}', '${groups!.length}'),
                                    style: const TextStyle(
                                        color: Colors.white54, fontSize: 12)),
                                const SizedBox(height: 8),
                                Expanded(
                                  child: ListView.builder(
                                    itemCount: groups!.length,
                                    itemBuilder: (_, i) {
                                      final g = groups![i];
                                      final gId = g['groupId'] as String;
                                      final updateTime =
                                          g['updateTime'] as String?;
                                      final dt = updateTime != null
                                          ? DateTime.tryParse(updateTime)
                                              ?.toLocal()
                                          : null;
                                      final dtStr = dt != null
                                          ? '${dt.year}/${dt.month.toString().padLeft(2, '0')}/${dt.day.toString().padLeft(2, '0')} ${dt.hour.toString().padLeft(2, '0')}:${dt.minute.toString().padLeft(2, '0')}'
                                          : provider.t('common.unknown');
                                      return Container(
                                        margin:
                                            const EdgeInsets.only(bottom: 6),
                                        decoration: BoxDecoration(
                                          color: Colors.white
                                              .withValues(alpha: 0.05),
                                          borderRadius:
                                              BorderRadius.circular(8),
                                          border: Border.all(
                                              color: Colors.white
                                                  .withValues(alpha: 0.08)),
                                        ),
                                        child: ListTile(
                                          dense: true,
                                          leading: const Icon(
                                              Icons.folder_rounded,
                                              color: Color(0xFFFFB347),
                                              size: 18),
                                          title: Text(gId,
                                              style: const TextStyle(
                                                  color: Colors.white,
                                                  fontSize: 13,
                                                  fontFamily: 'monospace')),
                                          subtitle: Text(
                                              provider
                                                  .t('admin.lastUpdated')
                                                  .replaceFirst('{dt}', dtStr),
                                              style: const TextStyle(
                                                  color: Colors.white38,
                                                  fontSize: 11)),
                                          trailing: Row(
                                            mainAxisSize: MainAxisSize.min,
                                            children: [
                                              IconButton(
                                                icon: const Icon(
                                                    Icons.visibility_rounded,
                                                    color: Colors.white54,
                                                    size: 18),
                                                tooltip: provider
                                                    .t('admin.showPages'),
                                                onPressed: () async {
                                                  final pages = await provider
                                                      .fetchGroupPages(gId);
                                                  if (!sctx.mounted) return;
                                                  _showGroupPagesDialog(sctx,
                                                      provider, gId, pages);
                                                },
                                              ),
                                            ],
                                          ),
                                        ),
                                      );
                                    },
                                  ),
                                ),
                              ],
                            ),
            ),
          );
        },
      ),
    );
  }

  /// 管理者：指定グループのページ一覧
  void _showGroupPagesDialog(BuildContext ctx, MindMapProvider provider,
      String groupId, List<Map<String, dynamic>> pages) {
    showDialog(
      context: ctx,
      builder: (dctx) => StatefulBuilder(
        builder: (sctx, setD) => AlertDialog(
          backgroundColor: const Color(0xFF12121F),
          shape:
              RoundedRectangleBorder(borderRadius: BorderRadius.circular(16)),
          title: Row(children: [
            const Icon(Icons.folder_open_rounded,
                color: Color(0xFFFFB347), size: 20),
            const SizedBox(width: 8),
            Expanded(
              child: Text(
                  provider.t('admin.groupLabel').replaceFirst('{gid}', groupId),
                  style: const TextStyle(
                      color: Colors.white,
                      fontSize: 14,
                      fontFamily: 'monospace'),
                  overflow: TextOverflow.ellipsis),
            ),
          ]),
          content: SizedBox(
            width: 400,
            height: 380,
            child: pages.isEmpty
                ? Center(
                    child: Text(provider.t('admin.noPages'),
                        style: const TextStyle(color: Colors.white54)))
                : ListView.builder(
                    itemCount: pages.length,
                    itemBuilder: (_, i) {
                      final p = pages[i];
                      final updateTime = p['updateTime'] as String?;
                      final dt = updateTime != null
                          ? DateTime.tryParse(updateTime)?.toLocal()
                          : null;
                      final dtStr = dt != null
                          ? '${dt.year}/${dt.month.toString().padLeft(2, '0')}/${dt.day.toString().padLeft(2, '0')} ${dt.hour.toString().padLeft(2, '0')}:${dt.minute.toString().padLeft(2, '0')}'
                          : provider.t('common.unknown');
                      return Container(
                        margin: const EdgeInsets.only(bottom: 6),
                        decoration: BoxDecoration(
                          color: Colors.white.withValues(alpha: 0.05),
                          borderRadius: BorderRadius.circular(8),
                          border: Border.all(
                              color: Colors.white.withValues(alpha: 0.08)),
                        ),
                        child: ListTile(
                          dense: true,
                          leading: const Icon(Icons.map_rounded,
                              color: Color(0xFF6C63FF), size: 18),
                          title: Text(
                              p['pageName'] as String? ??
                                  provider.t('common.noName'),
                              style: const TextStyle(
                                  color: Colors.white, fontSize: 13)),
                          subtitle: Column(
                            crossAxisAlignment: CrossAxisAlignment.start,
                            children: [
                              Text(
                                  provider
                                      .t('admin.nodeCount')
                                      .replaceFirst('{n}', '${p['nodeCount']}'),
                                  style: const TextStyle(
                                      color: Colors.white38, fontSize: 11)),
                              Text(
                                  provider
                                      .t('admin.lastUpdated')
                                      .replaceFirst('{dt}', dtStr),
                                  style: const TextStyle(
                                      color: Colors.white38, fontSize: 11)),
                            ],
                          ),
                          isThreeLine: true,
                          trailing: IconButton(
                            icon: const Icon(Icons.delete_rounded,
                                color: Colors.redAccent, size: 18),
                            tooltip: provider.t('btn.delete'),
                            onPressed: () async {
                              final confirm = await showDialog<bool>(
                                context: sctx,
                                builder: (c) => AlertDialog(
                                  backgroundColor: const Color(0xFF2A2A3E),
                                  title: Text(
                                      provider.t('common.deleteConfirmTitle'),
                                      style:
                                          const TextStyle(color: Colors.white)),
                                  content: Text(
                                      provider
                                          .t('admin.deletePageConfirm')
                                          .replaceFirst(
                                              '{name}', '${p['pageName']}'),
                                      style: const TextStyle(
                                          color: Colors.white70)),
                                  actions: [
                                    TextButton(
                                        onPressed: () =>
                                            Navigator.pop(c, false),
                                        child: Text(provider.t('btn.cancel'))),
                                    ElevatedButton(
                                      style: ElevatedButton.styleFrom(
                                          backgroundColor: Colors.redAccent,
                                          foregroundColor: Colors.white,),
                                      onPressed: () => Navigator.pop(c, true),
                                      child: Text(provider.t('btn.delete')),
                                    ),
                                  ],
                                ),
                              );
                              if (confirm != true) return;
                              final ok = await provider.adminDeletePage(
                                  groupId, p['pageId'] as String);
                              if (!sctx.mounted) return;
                              if (ok) {
                                setD(() => pages.removeAt(i));
                                _appSnack(
                                  sctx,
                                  SnackBar(
                                      content:
                                          Text(provider.t('admin.deleted')),
                                      backgroundColor: const Color(0xFF43B97F)),
                                );
                              } else {
                                _appSnack(
                                  sctx,
                                  SnackBar(
                                      content: Text(
                                          provider.t('admin.deleteFailed')),
                                      backgroundColor: Colors.redAccent),
                                );
                              }
                            },
                          ),
                        ),
                      );
                    },
                  ),
          ),
          actions: [
            TextButton(
              onPressed: () => Navigator.pop(dctx),
              child: Text(provider.t('btn.close'),
                  style: const TextStyle(color: Colors.white54)),
            ),
          ],
        ),
      ),
    );
  }

  // ─── ノード検索・置換 ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────

  void _performSearch(String query, MindMapProvider provider) {
    final q = query.toLowerCase();
    if (q.isEmpty) {
      setState(() {
        _searchResultIds = [];
        _searchResultIndex = 0;
      });
      return;
    }
    final hits = provider.nodes.values
        .where((n) =>
            n.title.toLowerCase().contains(q) ||
            (n.memoText ?? '').toLowerCase().contains(q))
        .map((n) => n.id)
        .toList();
    setState(() {
      _searchQuery = query;
      _searchResultIds = hits;
      _searchResultIndex = 0;
    });
    if (hits.isNotEmpty) _navigateToSearchResult(0, provider);
  }

  void _navigateToSearchResult(int index, MindMapProvider provider) {
    if (_searchResultIds.isEmpty) return;
    final node = provider.nodes[_searchResultIds[index]];
    if (node == null) return;
    setState(() => _searchResultIndex = index);
    _ctrlFor(provider.currentPage.id).value =
        _matrixFor(node.position, _percentToScale(_scalePercent));
  }

  void _replaceCurrentResult(MindMapProvider provider) {
    if (_searchResultIds.isEmpty) return;
    final query = _searchQuery;
    final replacement = _replaceCtrl.text;
    if (query.isEmpty) return;
    final id = _searchResultIds[_searchResultIndex];
    final node = provider.nodes[id];
    if (node == null) return;
    // タイトルの置換
    if (node.title.toLowerCase().contains(query.toLowerCase())) {
      final newTitle = node.title.replaceAll(
          RegExp(RegExp.escape(query), caseSensitive: false), replacement);
      provider.updateNodeTitle(id, newTitle);
    }
    // メモの置換
    final memo = node.memoText ?? '';
    if (memo.toLowerCase().contains(query.toLowerCase())) {
      final newMemo = memo.replaceAll(
          RegExp(RegExp.escape(query), caseSensitive: false), replacement);
      provider.updateNodeMemo(id, newMemo);
    }
    // 置換後に再検索
    _performSearch(_searchCtrl.text, provider);
  }

  void _replaceAllResults(MindMapProvider provider) {
    if (_searchResultIds.isEmpty) return;
    final query = _searchQuery;
    final replacement = _replaceCtrl.text;
    if (query.isEmpty) return;
    final pattern = RegExp(RegExp.escape(query), caseSensitive: false);
    for (final id in List.of(_searchResultIds)) {
      final node = provider.nodes[id];
      if (node == null) continue;
      if (node.title.toLowerCase().contains(query.toLowerCase())) {
        provider.updateNodeTitle(
            id, node.title.replaceAll(pattern, replacement));
      }
      final memo = node.memoText ?? '';
      if (memo.toLowerCase().contains(query.toLowerCase())) {
        provider.updateNodeMemo(id, memo.replaceAll(pattern, replacement));
      }
    }
    // 全置換後に再検索（結果は0件になるはず）
    _performSearch(_searchCtrl.text, provider);
  }

  Widget _buildSearchPanel(MindMapProvider provider) {
    final count = _searchResultIds.length;
    final current = count > 0 ? _searchResultIndex + 1 : 0;
    const panelColor = Color(0xFF1E1E2E);
    const borderColor = Colors.white12;
    return Positioned(
      top: 12,
      right: 16,
      child: Material(
        color: Colors.transparent,
        child: Container(
          padding: const EdgeInsets.symmetric(horizontal: 10, vertical: 6),
          decoration: BoxDecoration(
            color: panelColor,
            borderRadius: BorderRadius.circular(12),
            border: Border.all(color: borderColor),
            boxShadow: [
              BoxShadow(
                  color: Colors.black.withValues(alpha: 0.4), blurRadius: 12)
            ],
          ),
          child: Column(
            mainAxisSize: MainAxisSize.min,
            crossAxisAlignment: CrossAxisAlignment.start,
            children: [
              // ── 検索行 ──
              Row(mainAxisSize: MainAxisSize.min, children: [
                const Icon(Icons.search, color: Colors.white54, size: 16),
                const SizedBox(width: 6),
                SizedBox(
                  width: 180,
                  child: TextField(
                    controller: _searchCtrl,
                    focusNode: _searchFocusNode,
                    style: const TextStyle(color: Colors.white, fontSize: 13),
                    decoration: InputDecoration(
                      hintText: provider.t('search.hint'),
                      hintStyle: TextStyle(color: Colors.white38, fontSize: 12),
                      isDense: true,
                      border: InputBorder.none,
                      contentPadding: EdgeInsets.zero,
                    ),
                    onChanged: (v) => _performSearch(v, provider),
                    onSubmitted: (_) {
                      if (count > 0) {
                        _navigateToSearchResult(
                            (_searchResultIndex + 1) % count, provider);
                      }
                    },
                  ),
                ),
                const SizedBox(width: 6),
                Text(
                  count > 0 ? '$current / $count' : '0件',
                  style: TextStyle(
                      color: count > 0 ? Colors.white70 : Colors.white38,
                      fontSize: 11),
                ),
                const SizedBox(width: 2),
                IconButton(
                  icon: const Icon(Icons.keyboard_arrow_up,
                      color: Colors.white54, size: 16),
                  padding: EdgeInsets.zero,
                  constraints:
                      const BoxConstraints(minWidth: 24, minHeight: 24),
                  tooltip: provider.t('search.prev'),
                  onPressed: count > 0
                      ? () => _navigateToSearchResult(
                          (_searchResultIndex - 1 + count) % count, provider)
                      : null,
                ),
                IconButton(
                  icon: const Icon(Icons.keyboard_arrow_down,
                      color: Colors.white54, size: 16),
                  padding: EdgeInsets.zero,
                  constraints:
                      const BoxConstraints(minWidth: 24, minHeight: 24),
                  tooltip: provider.t('search.next'),
                  onPressed: count > 0
                      ? () => _navigateToSearchResult(
                          (_searchResultIndex + 1) % count, provider)
                      : null,
                ),
                // 置換トグルボタン
                IconButton(
                  icon: Icon(
                    _searchReplaceExpanded
                        ? Icons.expand_less
                        : Icons.find_replace_rounded,
                    color: _searchReplaceExpanded
                        ? const Color(0xFF6C63FF)
                        : Colors.white38,
                    size: 16,
                  ),
                  padding: EdgeInsets.zero,
                  constraints:
                      const BoxConstraints(minWidth: 24, minHeight: 24),
                  tooltip: provider.t('search.replace'),
                  onPressed: () => setState(
                      () => _searchReplaceExpanded = !_searchReplaceExpanded),
                ),
                IconButton(
                  icon:
                      const Icon(Icons.close, color: Colors.white38, size: 14),
                  padding: EdgeInsets.zero,
                  constraints:
                      const BoxConstraints(minWidth: 24, minHeight: 24),
                  onPressed: () {
                    setState(() {
                      _searchVisible = false;
                      _searchReplaceExpanded = false;
                      _searchResultIds = [];
                    });
                    _keyboardFocusNode.requestFocus();
                  },
                ),
              ]),
              // ── 置換行（展開時のみ）──
              if (_searchReplaceExpanded) ...[
                const SizedBox(height: 6),
                Container(
                  height: 1,
                  color: Colors.white12,
                  margin: const EdgeInsets.symmetric(horizontal: 2),
                ),
                const SizedBox(height: 6),
                Row(mainAxisSize: MainAxisSize.min, children: [
                  const Icon(Icons.edit_rounded,
                      color: Colors.white38, size: 16),
                  const SizedBox(width: 6),
                  SizedBox(
                    width: 180,
                    child: TextField(
                      controller: _replaceCtrl,
                      focusNode: _replaceFocusNode,
                      style: const TextStyle(color: Colors.white, fontSize: 13),
                      decoration: InputDecoration(
                        hintText: provider.t('search.replaceHint'),
                        hintStyle: const TextStyle(
                            color: Colors.white38, fontSize: 12),
                        isDense: true,
                        border: InputBorder.none,
                        contentPadding: EdgeInsets.zero,
                      ),
                      onSubmitted: (_) => _replaceCurrentResult(provider),
                    ),
                  ),
                  const SizedBox(width: 6),
                  // 1件置換
                  GestureDetector(
                    onTap: count > 0
                        ? () => _replaceCurrentResult(provider)
                        : null,
                    child: Container(
                      padding: const EdgeInsets.symmetric(
                          horizontal: 8, vertical: 4),
                      decoration: BoxDecoration(
                        color: count > 0
                            ? const Color(0xFF6C63FF).withValues(alpha: 0.2)
                            : Colors.white.withValues(alpha: 0.05),
                        borderRadius: BorderRadius.circular(6),
                        border: Border.all(
                            color: count > 0
                                ? const Color(0xFF6C63FF).withValues(alpha: 0.5)
                                : Colors.white12),
                      ),
                      child: Text(provider.t('search.replace'),
                          style: TextStyle(
                              color: count > 0
                                  ? const Color(0xFF6C63FF)
                                  : Colors.white24,
                              fontSize: 11,
                              fontWeight: FontWeight.w600)),
                    ),
                  ),
                  const SizedBox(width: 6),
                  // 全て置換
                  GestureDetector(
                    onTap:
                        count > 0 ? () => _replaceAllResults(provider) : null,
                    child: Container(
                      padding: const EdgeInsets.symmetric(
                          horizontal: 8, vertical: 4),
                      decoration: BoxDecoration(
                        // 旧 Colors.amber は黄色系 (視認性が低い) のため
                        // シアン (Cyan A400) に統一
                        color: count > 0
                            ? const Color(0xFF00E5FF).withValues(alpha: 0.15)
                            : Colors.white.withValues(alpha: 0.05),
                        borderRadius: BorderRadius.circular(6),
                        border: Border.all(
                            color: count > 0
                                ? const Color(0xFF00E5FF).withValues(alpha: 0.5)
                                : Colors.white12),
                      ),
                      child: Text(provider.t('search.replaceAll'),
                          style: TextStyle(
                              color: count > 0
                                  ? const Color(0xFF00E5FF)
                                  : Colors.white24,
                              fontSize: 11,
                              fontWeight: FontWeight.w600)),
                    ),
                  ),
                ]),
              ],
            ],
          ),
        ),
      ),
    );
  }

  void _autoSyncCurrentPage(
      BuildContext context, MindMapProvider provider) async {
    if (!provider.isSyncEnabled) {
      if (!mounted) return;
      _appSnack(
          context,
          SnackBar(
            content: Text(provider.t('sync.joinGroupFirst')),
            backgroundColor: Colors.redAccent,
            duration: const Duration(seconds: 2),
          ));
      return;
    }
    final result = await provider.autoSyncCurrentPage();
    if (!mounted) return;
    switch (result) {
      case 'downloaded':
        _appSnack(
            context,
            SnackBar(
              content: Text(provider
                  .t('sync.pageUpdated')
                  .replaceFirst('{name}', provider.currentPage.name)),
              backgroundColor: const Color(0xFF43B97F),
              duration: const Duration(seconds: 2),
            ));
      case 'up_to_date':
        _appSnack(
            context,
            SnackBar(
              content: Text(provider.t('sync.upToDate')),
              duration: const Duration(seconds: 1),
            ));
      case 'not_synced':
        _appSnack(
            context,
            SnackBar(
              content: Text(provider.t('sync.notUploaded')),
              duration: const Duration(seconds: 2),
            ));
      default:
        final msg = result.startsWith('error:') ? result.substring(6) : result;
        _appSnack(
            context,
            SnackBar(
              content:
                  Text(provider.t('sync.error').replaceFirst('{err}', msg)),
              backgroundColor: Colors.redAccent,
            ));
    }
  }

  void _deleteCurrentPageDialog(
      BuildContext context, MindMapProvider provider) {
    if (provider.pages.length <= 1) {
      _appSnack(
          context,
          SnackBar(
            content: Text(provider.t('map.cannotDeleteLast')),
            backgroundColor: Colors.redAccent,
            duration: const Duration(seconds: 2),
          ));
      return;
    }
    final name = provider.currentPage.name;
    final focusNode = FocusNode();
    showDialog(
      context: context,
      builder: (ctx) {
        void doDelete() {
          Navigator.pop(ctx);
          provider.deletePage(provider.currentPageIndex);
          _showDeletedPageUndoSnack(context, provider, name, empty: false);
        }

        return KeyboardListener(
          focusNode: focusNode,
          autofocus: true,
          onKeyEvent: (event) {
            if (event is! KeyDownEvent) return;
            if (event.logicalKey == LogicalKeyboardKey.enter ||
                event.logicalKey == LogicalKeyboardKey.numpadEnter) {
              doDelete();
            } else if (event.logicalKey == LogicalKeyboardKey.escape) {
              Navigator.pop(ctx);
            }
          },
          child: AlertDialog(
            backgroundColor: const Color(0xFF2A2A3E),
            shape:
                RoundedRectangleBorder(borderRadius: BorderRadius.circular(14)),
            title: Text(provider.t('map.deleteTitle'),
                style: const TextStyle(color: Colors.white, fontSize: 16)),
            content: Text(
                provider.t('map.deleteConfirm').replaceFirst('{name}', name),
                style: const TextStyle(color: Colors.white70, fontSize: 14)),
            actions: [
              TextButton(
                onPressed: () => Navigator.pop(ctx),
                child: Text(provider.t('btn.cancel'),
                    style: const TextStyle(color: Colors.white54)),
              ),
              ElevatedButton(
                style: ElevatedButton.styleFrom(
                    backgroundColor: Colors.redAccent,
                    foregroundColor: Colors.white,
                    padding: const EdgeInsets.symmetric(
                        horizontal: 20, vertical: 10)),
                onPressed: doDelete,
                child: Text(provider.t('btn.delete'),
                    style: const TextStyle(
                        color: Colors.white, fontWeight: FontWeight.w700)),
              ),
            ],
          ),
        );
      },
    );
  }

  /// オフライン動画を含むページを Ctrl+S した時に選択肢ダイアログを出す。
  ///
  /// 「URL のみ」を選ぶと `provider.skipVideoUploadOnce = true` をセットして
  /// 動画ファイルアップロードをスキップする。「動画データも」を選んだ場合は
  /// 通常通り (動画ファイルもアップロード)。キャンセル時は同期しない。
  void _askVideoUploadModeAndSync(
      BuildContext ctx, MindMapProvider provider) async {
    final choice = await showDialog<String>(
      context: ctx,
      builder: (dctx) => AlertDialog(
        backgroundColor: const Color(0xFF1E1E32),
        shape: RoundedRectangleBorder(borderRadius: BorderRadius.circular(14)),
        title: Row(children: [
          const Icon(Icons.cloud_upload_rounded,
              color: Color(0xFF43B97F), size: 20),
          const SizedBox(width: 8),
          Expanded(
            child: Text(provider.t('offline.title'),
                style: const TextStyle(color: Colors.white, fontSize: 15)),
          ),
        ]),
        content: Text(provider.t('offline.body'),
            style: const TextStyle(color: Colors.white70, fontSize: 12)),
        actions: [
          TextButton(
            onPressed: () => Navigator.pop(dctx, null),
            child: Text(provider.t('btn.cancel'),
                style: const TextStyle(color: Colors.white60)),
          ),
          TextButton(
            onPressed: () => Navigator.pop(dctx, 'url_only'),
            child: Text(provider.t('offline.urlOnly'),
                style: const TextStyle(color: Color(0xFF4FC3F7))),
          ),
          ElevatedButton(
            autofocus: true, // Enter で「動画データも」 (= 既定の挙動)
            style: ElevatedButton.styleFrom(
                backgroundColor: const Color(0xFF43B97F),
                foregroundColor: Colors.black),
            onPressed: () => Navigator.pop(dctx, 'with_video'),
            child: Text(provider.t('offline.withVideo'),
                style: TextStyle(fontWeight: FontWeight.w700)),
          ),
        ],
      ),
    );
    if (choice == null) return; // キャンセル
    provider.skipVideoUploadOnce = (choice == 'url_only');
    if (mounted) {
      _syncCurrentPageToCloud(provider);
    }
  }

  /// Ctrl+S: 差分だけアップロード (= ユーザー要望)。 現在マップが前回アップロード
  /// から内容が変わっていなければスキップする。
  void _diffUploadCurrentPage(MindMapProvider provider) async {
    if (!provider.isSyncEnabled) {
      if (mounted) {
        _appSnack(
            context,
            SnackBar(
              content: Text(provider.t('sync.joinGroupFirst')),
              backgroundColor: Colors.redAccent,
            ));
      }
      return;
    }
    final needed = await provider.isCurrentPageUploadNeeded();
    if (!mounted) return;
    if (!needed) {
      _appSnack(
          context,
          SnackBar(
            content: Text(provider.t('sync.noChanges')),
            backgroundColor: const Color(0xFF607D8B),
            duration: const Duration(seconds: 2),
          ));
      return;
    }
    _syncCurrentPageToCloud(provider);
  }

  /// Ctrl+D: 差分だけダウンロード (= ユーザー要望)。 クラウドが新しい時だけ
  /// 現在マップを取り込む (autoSyncCurrentPage を利用)。
  void _diffDownloadCurrentPage(MindMapProvider provider) async {
    if (!provider.isSyncEnabled) {
      if (mounted) {
        _appSnack(
            context,
            SnackBar(
              content: Text(provider.t('sync.joinGroupFirst')),
              backgroundColor: Colors.redAccent,
            ));
      }
      return;
    }
    _appSnack(
        context,
        SnackBar(
          content: Text(provider.t('sync.checkingDiff')),
          duration: const Duration(seconds: 1),
        ));
    try {
      final r = await provider.autoSyncCurrentPage();
      if (!mounted) return;
      String msg;
      Color c;
      switch (r) {
        case 'downloaded':
          if (provider.lastSyncLimitMessage != null) {
            msg = '⚠ ${provider.lastSyncLimitMessage}';
            c = const Color(0xFFFFB74D);
          } else if (provider.lastSyncAttachmentFailed) {
            msg = provider.t('download.attachmentFailedRetry');
            c = const Color(0xFFFF6B6B);
          } else {
            msg = provider.t('download.latestDownloaded');
            c = const Color(0xFF43B97F);
          }
          break;
        case 'up_to_date':
          msg = provider.t('sync.upToDate');
          c = const Color(0xFF607D8B);
          break;
        case 'not_synced':
          msg = provider.t('sync.notUploaded');
          c = const Color(0xFF607D8B);
          break;
        default:
          msg = r;
          c = const Color(0xFF607D8B);
      }
      _appSnack(
          context,
          SnackBar(
            content: Text(msg),
            backgroundColor: c,
            action: r == 'downloaded'
                ? SnackBarAction(
                    label: provider.t('download.details'),
                    textColor: Colors.white,
                    onPressed: () =>
                        _showCloudDownloadDetailsDialog(context, provider),
                  )
                : null,
            duration: const Duration(seconds: 2),
          ));
    } catch (e) {
      if (mounted) {
        _appSnack(
            context,
            SnackBar(
              content: Text(
                  provider.t('download.error').replaceFirst('{err}', '$e')),
              backgroundColor: Colors.redAccent,
            ));
      }
    }
  }

  void _syncCurrentPageToCloud(MindMapProvider provider) async {
    if (!provider.isSyncEnabled) {
      if (mounted) {
        _appSnack(
            context,
            SnackBar(
              content: Text(provider.t('sync.joinGroupFirst')),
              backgroundColor: Colors.redAccent,
            ));
      }
      return;
    }
    try {
      await provider.syncCurrentPageToCloud();
      if (mounted) {
        _appSnack(
            context,
            SnackBar(
              content: Text(provider
                  .t('sync.pageUploaded')
                  .replaceFirst('{name}', provider.currentPage.name)),
              backgroundColor: const Color(0xFF43B97F),
              duration: const Duration(seconds: 2),
            ));
      }
    } catch (e) {
      if (mounted) {
        _appSnack(
            context,
            SnackBar(
              content:
                  Text(provider.t('upload.error').replaceFirst('{err}', '$e')),
              backgroundColor: Colors.redAccent,
            ));
      }
    }
  }

  /// カレンダーモード中の Ctrl+S: カレンダーイベントを Firebase クラウドに保存。
  /// 旧バージョンには Google Calendar 同期も含まれていたが、機能廃止のため
  /// Firebase 経由 (同期グループに参加しているメンバー間での共有) のみとなる。
  void _uploadCalendarToCloud(MindMapProvider provider) async {
    if (!provider.isSyncEnabled) {
      if (mounted) {
        _appSnack(
            context,
            SnackBar(
              content: Text(provider.t('sync.joinGroupFirst')),
              backgroundColor: Colors.redAccent,
            ));
      }
      return;
    }
    final messenger = ScaffoldMessenger.of(context);
    _appSnackM(
        messenger,
        SnackBar(
          content: Text(provider.t('cal.uploading')),
          duration: const Duration(seconds: 2),
        ));
    try {
      var result = await provider.uploadCalendarEventsToCloud();
      // 共有 OFF で失敗した場合 → ユーザーに有効化を提案して再実行
      if (!result.success && result.error == 'sharing_disabled') {
        messenger.hideCurrentSnackBar();
        final enable = await _confirmEnableCalendarSharing(provider);
        if (enable) {
          await provider.setCalendarGroupSharingEnabled(true);
          _appSnackM(
              messenger,
              SnackBar(
                content: Text(provider.t('cal.uploading')),
                duration: const Duration(seconds: 2),
              ));
          result = await provider.uploadCalendarEventsToCloud();
        }
      }
      messenger.hideCurrentSnackBar();
      if (result.success) {
        _appSnackM(
            messenger,
            SnackBar(
              content: Text(provider
                  .t('cal.savedCount')
                  .replaceFirst('{n}', '${result.count}')),
              backgroundColor: const Color(0xFF43B97F),
              duration: const Duration(seconds: 3),
            ));
      } else if (result.error != 'sharing_disabled') {
        // 'sharing_disabled' の場合はユーザーがキャンセルしただけなので黙る
        _appSnackM(
            messenger,
            SnackBar(
              content: Text(provider
                  .t('cal.uploadFailed')
                  .replaceFirst('{err}', '${result.error}')),
              backgroundColor: Colors.redAccent,
            ));
      }
    } catch (e) {
      messenger.hideCurrentSnackBar();
      _appSnackM(
          messenger,
          SnackBar(
            content:
                Text(provider.t('cal.errorMark').replaceFirst('{err}', '$e')),
            backgroundColor: Colors.redAccent,
          ));
    }
  }

  /// カレンダー共有が OFF の時に確認ダイアログを出す。
  /// true: ユーザーが「有効化して続行」を選択、false: キャンセル
  Future<bool> _confirmEnableCalendarSharing(MindMapProvider provider) async {
    if (!mounted) return false;
    final result = await showDialog<bool>(
      context: context,
      builder: (dctx) => AlertDialog(
        backgroundColor: const Color(0xFF2A2A3E),
        shape: RoundedRectangleBorder(borderRadius: BorderRadius.circular(12)),
        title: Row(children: [
          const Icon(Icons.lock_outline_rounded,
              color: Color(0xFFFFB347), size: 22),
          const SizedBox(width: 10),
          Expanded(
            child: Text(provider.t('menu.calendarSharing'),
                style: const TextStyle(
                    color: Colors.white,
                    fontSize: 15,
                    fontWeight: FontWeight.w700)),
          ),
        ]),
        content: Text(
          provider.t('cal.sharingDisabledBody'),
          style: const TextStyle(color: Colors.white70, fontSize: 12),
        ),
        actions: [
          TextButton(
            onPressed: () => Navigator.pop(dctx, false),
            child: Text(provider.t('btn.cancel'),
                style: const TextStyle(color: Colors.white54)),
          ),
          ElevatedButton.icon(
            icon: const Icon(Icons.share_rounded, size: 16),
            style: ElevatedButton.styleFrom(
              backgroundColor: const Color(0xFF4FC3F7),
              foregroundColor: Colors.white,
            ),
            onPressed: () => Navigator.pop(dctx, true),
            label: Text(provider.t('cal.enableUpload'),
                style: const TextStyle(fontWeight: FontWeight.w700)),
          ),
        ],
      ),
    );
    return result == true;
  }

  /// カレンダーモード中の Ctrl+D: Firebase クラウドからイベントを取得。
  /// 旧バージョンは Google Calendar からの取得もサポートしていたが、機能廃止。
  void _downloadCalendarFromCloud(MindMapProvider provider) async {
    if (!provider.isSyncEnabled) {
      if (mounted) {
        _appSnack(
            context,
            SnackBar(
              content: Text(provider.t('sync.joinGroupFirst')),
              backgroundColor: Colors.redAccent,
            ));
      }
      return;
    }
    final messenger = ScaffoldMessenger.of(context);
    _appSnackM(
        messenger,
        SnackBar(
          content: Text(provider.t('cal.fetching')),
          duration: const Duration(seconds: 2),
        ));
    try {
      final result = await provider.downloadCalendarEventsFromCloud();
      messenger.hideCurrentSnackBar();
      _appSnackM(
          messenger,
          SnackBar(
            content: Text(result.success
                ? provider
                    .t('cal.fetchedCount')
                    .replaceFirst('{n}', '${result.count}')
                : provider
                    .t('cal.fetchFailed')
                    .replaceFirst('{err}', '${result.error}')),
            backgroundColor:
                result.success ? const Color(0xFF43B97F) : Colors.redAccent,
            duration: const Duration(seconds: 3),
          ));
    } catch (e) {
      messenger.hideCurrentSnackBar();
      _appSnackM(
          messenger,
          SnackBar(
            content:
                Text(provider.t('cal.errorMark').replaceFirst('{err}', '$e')),
            backgroundColor: Colors.redAccent,
          ));
    }
  }

  // (旧) `_showCalendarSyncDestinationPicker` / `_showCalendarPullSourcePicker`
  // は Firebase / Google Calendar の選択 UI だったが、Google Calendar 連携の
  // 廃止により Firebase 一択になったため両ピッカーを削除した。
  // 呼び出し側 (`_uploadCalendarToCloud` / `_downloadCalendarFromCloud`) は
  // 直接 Firebase 経路に進むよう書き換え済み。

  void _showCloudDownloadDialog(
      BuildContext ctx, MindMapProvider provider) async {
    if (!provider.isSyncEnabled) {
      if (mounted) {
        _appSnack(
            ctx,
            SnackBar(
              content: Text(provider.t('sync.joinGroupFirst')),
              backgroundColor: Colors.redAccent,
            ));
      }
      return;
    }
    // ローディング表示
    showDialog(
      context: ctx,
      barrierDismissible: false,
      builder: (_) => const Center(
          child: CircularProgressIndicator(
              valueColor: AlwaysStoppedAnimation<Color>(Color(0xFF4FC3F7)))),
    );
    try {
      final cloudPages = await provider.fetchCloudPageList();
      if (mounted) Navigator.pop(ctx); // ローディング閉じる
      if (cloudPages.isEmpty) {
        if (mounted) {
          _appSnack(
              ctx,
              SnackBar(
                content: Text(provider.t('sync.noCloudPages')),
                backgroundColor: const Color(0xFFFFB347),
              ));
        }
        return;
      }
      if (!mounted) return;
      // 各ページの容量をJSONベースで先に算出（同期）
      final Map<String, int> sizeMap = {
        for (final p in cloudPages) p.id: provider.calculatePageSizeBytes(p),
      };
      // 添付ファイルを含む正確なサイズを非同期で取得
      final Map<String, bool> sizeFetching = {
        for (final p in cloudPages) p.id: true,
      };
      final selected = <String>{};
      // 削除モードフラグ
      bool deleteMode = false;
      late StateSetter setDStateRef;
      // バックグラウンドで実サイズ取得
      for (final p in cloudPages) {
        provider.fetchCloudPageSizeBytes(p).then((bytes) {
          sizeMap[p.id] = bytes;
          sizeFetching[p.id] = false;
          try {
            setDStateRef(() {});
          } catch (_) {}
        }).catchError((_) {
          sizeFetching[p.id] = false;
          try {
            setDStateRef(() {});
          } catch (_) {}
        });
      }
      showDialog(
        context: ctx,
        builder: (dctx) => StatefulBuilder(builder: (dctx, setDState) {
          setDStateRef = setDState;
          // 合計サイズ
          int totalSelectedBytes = 0;
          for (final id in selected) {
            totalSelectedBytes += sizeMap[id] ?? 0;
          }
          return AlertDialog(
            backgroundColor: const Color(0xFF2A2A3E),
            title: Row(children: [
              Icon(
                deleteMode
                    ? Icons.delete_forever_rounded
                    : Icons.cloud_download_rounded,
                color: deleteMode ? Colors.redAccent : const Color(0xFF4FC3F7),
                size: 20,
              ),
              const SizedBox(width: 8),
              Expanded(
                child: Text(
                  deleteMode
                      ? provider.t('download.deleteTitle')
                      : provider.t('sync.download'),
                  style: const TextStyle(color: Colors.white, fontSize: 14),
                ),
              ),
              // 削除モードトグルスイッチ
              GestureDetector(
                onTap: () => setDState(() => deleteMode = !deleteMode),
                child: Container(
                  padding:
                      const EdgeInsets.symmetric(horizontal: 8, vertical: 4),
                  decoration: BoxDecoration(
                    color: deleteMode
                        ? Colors.redAccent.withValues(alpha: 0.2)
                        : Colors.white.withValues(alpha: 0.06),
                    borderRadius: BorderRadius.circular(8),
                    border: Border.all(
                      color: deleteMode
                          ? Colors.redAccent.withValues(alpha: 0.6)
                          : Colors.white24,
                      width: 1,
                    ),
                  ),
                  child: Row(mainAxisSize: MainAxisSize.min, children: [
                    Icon(
                      deleteMode
                          ? Icons.delete_outline_rounded
                          : Icons.delete_outline_rounded,
                      size: 12,
                      color: deleteMode ? Colors.redAccent : Colors.white70,
                    ),
                    const SizedBox(width: 4),
                    Text(
                      provider.t('download.deleteMode'),
                      style: TextStyle(
                        color: deleteMode ? Colors.redAccent : Colors.white70,
                        fontSize: 10,
                        fontWeight: FontWeight.w600,
                      ),
                    ),
                  ]),
                ),
              ),
            ]),
            content: SizedBox(
              width: 340,
              child: Column(mainAxisSize: MainAxisSize.min, children: [
                // 合計サイズ表示
                if (selected.isNotEmpty) ...[
                  Container(
                    padding:
                        const EdgeInsets.symmetric(horizontal: 10, vertical: 6),
                    decoration: BoxDecoration(
                      color: (deleteMode
                              ? Colors.redAccent
                              : const Color(0xFF4FC3F7))
                          .withValues(alpha: 0.12),
                      borderRadius: BorderRadius.circular(8),
                    ),
                    child: Row(children: [
                      Icon(
                        Icons.data_usage_rounded,
                        size: 12,
                        color: deleteMode
                            ? Colors.redAccent
                            : const Color(0xFF4FC3F7),
                      ),
                      const SizedBox(width: 6),
                      Text(
                        provider
                            .t('download.selectedTotal')
                            .replaceFirst('{size}',
                                MindMapProvider.formatBytes(totalSelectedBytes))
                            .replaceFirst('{n}', '${selected.length}'),
                        style: TextStyle(
                          color: deleteMode
                              ? Colors.redAccent
                              : const Color(0xFF4FC3F7),
                          fontSize: 11,
                          fontWeight: FontWeight.w600,
                        ),
                      ),
                    ]),
                  ),
                  const SizedBox(height: 6),
                ],
                ConstrainedBox(
                  constraints: const BoxConstraints(maxHeight: 360),
                  child: ListView(
                    shrinkWrap: true,
                    children: cloudPages.map((p) {
                      final isSelected = selected.contains(p.id);
                      final isLocal = provider.pages.any((lp) => lp.id == p.id);
                      final bytes = sizeMap[p.id] ?? 0;
                      final fetching = sizeFetching[p.id] ?? false;
                      final sizeText = fetching
                          ? '${MindMapProvider.formatBytes(bytes)}…'
                          : MindMapProvider.formatBytes(bytes);
                      return CheckboxListTile(
                        value: isSelected,
                        activeColor: deleteMode
                            ? const Color(0xFFFF6B6B)
                            : const Color(0xFF4FC3F7),
                        checkColor: const Color(0xFF101426),
                        side: const BorderSide(color: Colors.white70),
                        title: Text(p.name,
                            style: const TextStyle(
                                color: Colors.white, fontSize: 13)),
                        subtitle: Row(children: [
                          Text(
                            '${p.nodes.length}${provider.t('drawer.nodeSuffix')}',
                            style: const TextStyle(
                                color: Colors.white70, fontSize: 10),
                          ),
                          const Text(' · ',
                              style: TextStyle(
                                  color: Colors.white24, fontSize: 10)),
                          Icon(Icons.data_usage_rounded,
                              size: 9, color: Colors.white70),
                          const SizedBox(width: 2),
                          Text(
                            sizeText,
                            style: const TextStyle(
                                color: Colors.white70,
                                fontSize: 10,
                                fontWeight: FontWeight.w600),
                          ),
                          if (isLocal) ...[
                            const Text(' · ',
                                style: TextStyle(
                                    color: Colors.white24, fontSize: 10)),
                            Text(
                              deleteMode
                                  ? provider.t('download.localAlsoExists')
                                  : provider.t('download.localExists'),
                              style: const TextStyle(
                                  color: Color(0xFFFFB347),
                                  fontSize: 10,
                                  fontWeight: FontWeight.w500),
                            ),
                          ],
                        ]),
                        onChanged: (v) {
                          setDState(() {
                            if (v == true) {
                              selected.add(p.id);
                            } else {
                              selected.remove(p.id);
                            }
                          });
                        },
                      );
                    }).toList(),
                  ),
                ),
              ]),
            ),
            actions: [
              TextButton(
                onPressed: () {
                  setDState(() {
                    if (selected.length == cloudPages.length) {
                      selected.clear();
                    } else {
                      selected.addAll(cloudPages.map((p) => p.id));
                    }
                  });
                },
                child: Text(
                    selected.length == cloudPages.length
                        ? provider.t('btn.deselectAll')
                        : provider.t('btn.selectAll'),
                    style: const TextStyle(color: Colors.white70)),
              ),
              TextButton(
                  onPressed: () => Navigator.pop(dctx),
                  child: Text(provider.t('btn.cancel'),
                      style: const TextStyle(color: Colors.white70))),
              ElevatedButton.icon(
                onPressed: selected.isEmpty
                    ? null
                    : () async {
                        if (deleteMode) {
                          // 削除確認ダイアログ
                          final confirm = await showDialog<bool>(
                            context: dctx,
                            builder: (cctx) => AlertDialog(
                              backgroundColor: const Color(0xFF2A2A3E),
                              title: Text(provider.t('download.deleteTitle'),
                                  style: const TextStyle(
                                      color: Colors.white, fontSize: 14)),
                              content: Text(
                                provider
                                    .t('download.deleteConfirmLocal')
                                    .replaceFirst('{n}', '${selected.length}'),
                                style: const TextStyle(
                                    color: Colors.white70, fontSize: 13),
                              ),
                              actions: [
                                TextButton(
                                  onPressed: () => Navigator.pop(cctx, false),
                                  child: Text(provider.t('btn.cancel'),
                                      style: const TextStyle(
                                          color: Colors.white70)),
                                ),
                                ElevatedButton(
                                  style: ElevatedButton.styleFrom(
                                      backgroundColor: const Color(0xFFFF6B6B),
                                      foregroundColor: const Color(0xFF101426),
                                      textStyle: const TextStyle(
                                          fontWeight: FontWeight.w700)),
                                  onPressed: () => Navigator.pop(cctx, true),
                                  child: Text(provider.t('btn.deleteDo')),
                                ),
                              ],
                            ),
                          );
                          if (confirm != true) return;
                          Navigator.pop(dctx);
                          try {
                            await provider.deleteCloudPages(selected.toList());
                            if (mounted) {
                              _appSnack(
                                  context,
                                  SnackBar(
                                    content: Text(provider
                                        .t('download.deletedCount')
                                        .replaceFirst(
                                            '{n}', '${selected.length}')),
                                    backgroundColor: Colors.redAccent,
                                    duration: const Duration(seconds: 2),
                                  ));
                            }
                          } catch (e) {
                            if (mounted) {
                              _appSnack(
                                  context,
                                  SnackBar(
                                    content: Text(provider
                                        .t('download.deleteError')
                                        .replaceFirst('{err}', '$e')),
                                    backgroundColor: Colors.redAccent,
                                  ));
                            }
                          }
                        } else {
                          Navigator.pop(dctx);
                          try {
                            if (mounted) {
                              _appSnack(
                                  context,
                                  SnackBar(
                                    content:
                                        Text(provider.t('download.started')),
                                    backgroundColor: const Color(0xFF4FC3F7),
                                    action: SnackBarAction(
                                      label: provider.t('download.details'),
                                      textColor: Colors.white,
                                      onPressed: () =>
                                          _showCloudDownloadDetailsDialog(
                                              context, provider),
                                    ),
                                    duration: const Duration(seconds: 2),
                                  ));
                            }
                            await provider.downloadFromCloud(
                                cloudPages, selected.toList());
                            if (mounted) {
                              if (provider.lastSyncLimitMessage != null) {
                                _appSnack(
                                    context,
                                    SnackBar(
                                      content: Text(
                                          '⚠ ${provider.lastSyncLimitMessage}'),
                                      backgroundColor: const Color(0xFFFFB74D),
                                      duration: const Duration(seconds: 8),
                                    ));
                              } else if (provider.lastSyncAttachmentFailed) {
                                _appSnack(
                                    context,
                                    SnackBar(
                                      content: Text(provider
                                          .t('download.attachmentFailedRetry')),
                                      backgroundColor: const Color(0xFFFF6B6B),
                                      duration: const Duration(seconds: 5),
                                    ));
                              } else {
                                _appSnack(
                                    context,
                                    SnackBar(
                                      content: Text(provider
                                          .t('download.downloadedCount')
                                          .replaceFirst(
                                              '{n}', '${selected.length}')),
                                      backgroundColor: const Color(0xFF43B97F),
                                      duration: const Duration(seconds: 2),
                                    ));
                              }
                            }
                          } catch (e) {
                            if (mounted) {
                              _syncErrorSnack(provider, e, 'download.error');
                            }
                          }
                        }
                      },
                icon: Icon(
                  deleteMode
                      ? Icons.delete_forever_rounded
                      : Icons.cloud_download_rounded,
                  size: 16,
                ),
                label: Text(deleteMode
                    ? provider
                        .t('download.countDelete')
                        .replaceFirst('{n}', '${selected.length}')
                    : provider
                        .t('download.countAction')
                        .replaceFirst('{n}', '${selected.length}')),
                style: ElevatedButton.styleFrom(
                  backgroundColor:
                      deleteMode ? Colors.redAccent : const Color(0xFF4FC3F7),
                  foregroundColor:
                      deleteMode ? Colors.white : const Color(0xFF101426),
                  textStyle: const TextStyle(fontWeight: FontWeight.w700),
                ),
              ),
            ],
          );
        }),
      );
    } catch (e) {
      if (mounted) Navigator.pop(ctx); // ローディング閉じる
      if (mounted) {
        _appSnack(
            ctx,
            SnackBar(
              content: Text(provider
                  .t('sync.connectionError')
                  .replaceFirst('{err}', '$e')),
              backgroundColor: Colors.redAccent,
            ));
      }
    }
  }

  // ─── 範囲選択：他ページにコピー ──────────────────────────────────────────────

  /// 単一ノードを別ページへ「送る (移動)」 ダイアログ (= ユーザー要望: 要素を
  /// 右クリック→別ページに送る)。 現在ページ以外を選ばせ、 moveNodesToPage で
  /// コピー後に元ページから削除する。
  void _showSendNodeToPageDialog(String nodeId) {
    final provider = context.read<MindMapProvider>();
    final pages = provider.pages;
    final currentIdx = provider.currentPageIndex;
    final otherIdx = [
      for (int i = 0; i < pages.length; i++)
        if (i != currentIdx) i
    ];
    if (otherIdx.isEmpty) {
      _appSnack(
        context,
        SnackBar(content: Text(provider.t('sync.noOtherPages'))),
      );
      return;
    }
    showDialog(
      context: context,
      builder: (ctx) => AlertDialog(
        backgroundColor: const Color(0xFF2A2A3E),
        title: Text(provider.t('ctx.sendToPage'),
            style: const TextStyle(color: Colors.white, fontSize: 16)),
        content: SizedBox(
          width: 320,
          child: Column(
            mainAxisSize: MainAxisSize.min,
            children: [
              Flexible(
                child: ListView.builder(
                  shrinkWrap: true,
                  itemCount: otherIdx.length,
                  itemBuilder: (_, k) {
                    final i = otherIdx[k];
                    return ListTile(
                      // ページ一覧と同じ絵・色に揃える (= ユーザー要望:
                      // 種類に関係なく全部マインドマップの絵だった)。
                      leading: pageListIcon(provider, pages[i]),
                      title: Text(pages[i].name,
                          style: const TextStyle(
                              color: Colors.white, fontSize: 14)),
                      shape: RoundedRectangleBorder(
                          borderRadius: BorderRadius.circular(10)),
                      onTap: () {
                        Navigator.pop(ctx);
                        provider.moveNodesToPage({nodeId}, i);
                        _removeOverlay();
                        _appSnack(
                          context,
                          SnackBar(
                              content: Text(provider
                                  .t('ctx.sentToPage')
                                  .replaceAll('{name}', pages[i].name))),
                        );
                      },
                    );
                  },
                ),
              ),
              const Divider(color: Colors.white12, height: 16),
              // ── 新規ページを作成して送る (= ユーザー要望) ──
              // ── 新しいページを作って送る。 種類も選べる (= ユーザー要望:
              //    マインドマップしか作れなかった)。 ──
              for (final t in const [
                ('normal', 'drawer.newPage'),
                ('bookshelf', 'drawer.newBookshelfPage'),
                ('paint', 'drawer.newPaintPage'),
                ('document', 'drawer.newDocumentPage'),
                ('markdown', 'drawer.newMarkdownPage'),
                ('videoEditor', 'drawer.newVideoEditorPage'),
              ])
                ListTile(
                  dense: true,
                  leading: Icon(pageTypeDefaultIcon(t.$1),
                      color: _pageIconColorOf(t.$1), size: 18),
                  title: Text(provider.t(t.$2),
                      style: const TextStyle(
                          color: Colors.white, fontSize: 13.5)),
                  trailing: const Icon(Icons.add_circle_rounded,
                      color: Color(0xFF43B97F), size: 16),
                  shape: RoundedRectangleBorder(
                      borderRadius: BorderRadius.circular(10)),
                  onTap: () async {
                    Navigator.pop(ctx);
                    await _promptNewMapNameAndSendNode(nodeId, pageType: t.$1);
                  },
                ),
            ],
          ),
        ),
        actions: [
          TextButton(
              onPressed: () => Navigator.pop(ctx),
              child: Text(provider.t('btn.cancel'),
                  style: const TextStyle(color: Colors.white54))),
        ],
      ),
    );
  }

  /// 新規ページ名を入力 → ページ作成 → そのページへ単一ノードを送る
  /// (= ユーザー要望: 他のページに送る時に新規ページを作れるように。
  /// 種類も選べる)。
  Future<void> _promptNewMapNameAndSendNode(String nodeId,
      {String pageType = 'normal'}) async {
    final provider = context.read<MindMapProvider>();
    final controller = TextEditingController(
      text: 'マップ ${provider.pages.length + 1}',
    );
    final name = await showDialog<String>(
      context: context,
      builder: (ctx) => AlertDialog(
        backgroundColor: const Color(0xFF2A2A3E),
        title: Text(provider.t('copyTo.newMap'),
            style: const TextStyle(color: Colors.white, fontSize: 16)),
        content: TextField(
          controller: controller,
          autofocus: true,
          style: const TextStyle(color: Colors.white),
          decoration: InputDecoration(
            hintText: provider.t('copyTo.newMapNameHint'),
            hintStyle: const TextStyle(color: Colors.white38),
            enabledBorder: const UnderlineInputBorder(
                borderSide: BorderSide(color: Colors.white24)),
            focusedBorder: const UnderlineInputBorder(
                borderSide: BorderSide(color: Color(0xFF43B97F))),
          ),
          onSubmitted: (v) =>
              Navigator.pop(ctx, v.trim().isEmpty ? null : v.trim()),
        ),
        actions: [
          TextButton(
              onPressed: () => Navigator.pop(ctx, null),
              child: Text(provider.t('btn.cancel'),
                  style: const TextStyle(color: Colors.white54))),
          ElevatedButton(
            style: ElevatedButton.styleFrom(
              backgroundColor: const Color(0xFF43B97F),
              foregroundColor: Colors.white,
            ),
            onPressed: () {
              final v = controller.text.trim();
              Navigator.pop(ctx, v.isEmpty ? null : v);
            },
            child: Text(provider.t('page.create')),
          ),
        ],
      ),
    );
    if (name == null || name.isEmpty || !mounted) return;

    // 無料プランのページ上限はここでも守る。
    if (!provider.canCreatePageType(pageType)) {
      _showPaywallDialog(provider);
      return;
    }
    final originalIndex = provider.currentPageIndex;
    // 選んだ種類で作る (= ユーザー要望: マインドマップ以外も作れるように)。
    switch (pageType) {
      case 'bookshelf':
        provider.addBookshelfPage(name: name);
        break;
      case 'paint':
        provider.addPaintPage(name: name);
        break;
      case 'document':
        provider.addDocumentPage(name: name);
        break;
      case 'markdown':
        provider.addMarkdownPage(name: name);
        break;
      case 'videoEditor':
        provider.addVideoEditorPage(name: name);
        break;
      default:
        provider.addPage(name: name);
    }
    final newIndex = provider.pages.length - 1;
    provider.switchPage(originalIndex);
    provider.moveNodesToPage({nodeId}, newIndex);
    _removeOverlay();
    if (!mounted) return;
    _appSnack(
      context,
      SnackBar(
          content: Text(
              provider.t('ctx.sentToPage').replaceAll('{name}', name))),
    );
  }

  void _showCopyToPageDialog(BuildContext context, MindMapProvider provider) {
    final pages = provider.pages;
    final currentIdx = provider.currentPageIndex;

    showDialog(
      context: context,
      builder: (ctx) => AlertDialog(
        backgroundColor: const Color(0xFF2A2A3E),
        title: Text(provider.t('copyTo.title'),
            style: const TextStyle(color: Colors.white, fontSize: 16)),
        content: SizedBox(
          width: 320,
          child: Column(
            mainAxisSize: MainAxisSize.min,
            children: [
              Flexible(
                child: ListView.builder(
                  shrinkWrap: true,
                  itemCount: pages.length,
                  itemBuilder: (_, i) {
                    final isCurrent = i == currentIdx;
                    final label = isCurrent
                        ? '${pages[i].name}${provider.t('copyTo.currentSuffix')}'
                        : pages[i].name;
                    return ListTile(
                      leading: Icon(isCurrent ? Icons.map : Icons.map_outlined,
                          color: isCurrent
                              ? const Color(0xFF6C63FF)
                              : Colors.white54,
                          size: 18),
                      title: Text(label,
                          style: TextStyle(
                              color: isCurrent
                                  ? const Color(0xFF6C63FF)
                                  : Colors.white,
                              fontSize: 14)),
                      shape: RoundedRectangleBorder(
                          borderRadius: BorderRadius.circular(10)),
                      onTap: () {
                        Navigator.pop(ctx);
                        // 現在のページへの転送は無意味なので無視 (= 自分自身)。
                        if (i == currentIdx) return;
                        final copiedIds = Set.of(_rangeSelectedIds);
                        // = ユーザー要望: 「他ページに転送」 はコピーではなく移動。
                        //   コピー後に元ページの要素を削除する (moveNodesToPage)。
                        provider.moveNodesToPage(copiedIds, i);
                        _appSnack(
                          context,
                          SnackBar(
                              content: Text(provider
                                  .t('copyTo.copiedMsg')
                                  .replaceAll('{n}', '${copiedIds.length}')
                                  .replaceAll('{name}', pages[i].name))),
                        );
                        setState(() {
                          _rangeSelectedIds.clear();
                          _rangeSelectedDecorationIds.clear();
                          _rangeSelectMode = false;
                        });
                      },
                    );
                  },
                ),
              ),
              const Divider(color: Colors.white12, height: 16),
              // ── 新規マップを作成してコピー ──
              ListTile(
                leading: const Icon(Icons.add_circle_rounded,
                    color: Color(0xFF43B97F), size: 18),
                title: Text(provider.t('copyTo.newMap'),
                    style: const TextStyle(
                        color: Color(0xFF43B97F),
                        fontSize: 14,
                        fontWeight: FontWeight.w600)),
                shape: RoundedRectangleBorder(
                    borderRadius: BorderRadius.circular(10)),
                onTap: () async {
                  Navigator.pop(ctx);
                  await _promptNewMapNameAndCopy(context, provider);
                },
              ),
            ],
          ),
        ),
        actions: [
          TextButton(
              onPressed: () => Navigator.pop(ctx),
              child: Text(provider.t('btn.cancel'),
                  style: const TextStyle(color: Colors.white54))),
        ],
      ),
    );
  }

  /// 新規マップ名を入力 → ページ作成 → そのページにコピー
  Future<void> _promptNewMapNameAndCopy(
      BuildContext context, MindMapProvider provider) async {
    final controller = TextEditingController(
      text: 'マップ ${provider.pages.length + 1}',
    );
    final name = await showDialog<String>(
      context: context,
      builder: (ctx) => AlertDialog(
        backgroundColor: const Color(0xFF2A2A3E),
        title: Text(provider.t('copyTo.newMap'),
            style: const TextStyle(color: Colors.white, fontSize: 16)),
        content: TextField(
          controller: controller,
          autofocus: true,
          style: const TextStyle(color: Colors.white),
          decoration: InputDecoration(
            hintText: provider.t('copyTo.newMapNameHint'),
            hintStyle: const TextStyle(color: Colors.white38),
            enabledBorder: const UnderlineInputBorder(
                borderSide: BorderSide(color: Colors.white24)),
            focusedBorder: const UnderlineInputBorder(
                borderSide: BorderSide(color: Color(0xFF43B97F))),
          ),
          onSubmitted: (v) =>
              Navigator.pop(ctx, v.trim().isEmpty ? null : v.trim()),
        ),
        actions: [
          TextButton(
              onPressed: () => Navigator.pop(ctx, null),
              child: Text(provider.t('btn.cancel'),
                  style: const TextStyle(color: Colors.white54))),
          ElevatedButton(
            style: ElevatedButton.styleFrom(
                backgroundColor: const Color(0xFF43B97F),
                foregroundColor: Colors.white,),
            onPressed: () {
              final v = controller.text.trim();
              Navigator.pop(ctx, v.isEmpty ? null : v);
            },
            child: Text(provider.t('page.create')),
          ),
        ],
      ),
    );
    if (name == null || name.isEmpty) return;

    final copiedIds = Set.of(_rangeSelectedIds);
    if (copiedIds.isEmpty) return;

    // 現在ページインデックスを覚えておく
    final originalIndex = provider.currentPageIndex;

    // ── ペイウォールチェック ──
    // 「選択ノードを新ページにコピー」もページを 1 つ増やすので、
    // 無料プランの 2 ページ制限の対象。
    if (!provider.canCreatePageType('normal')) {
      _showPaywallDialog(provider);
      return;
    }

    // 新規ページ作成（addPageは自動でそのページに切り替わる）
    provider.addPage(name: name);
    final newIndex = provider.pages.length - 1;

    // 元のページに戻してから転送（moveNodesToPage は「元ページの選択ノードを
    //   対象ページに」コピーしてから元ページの要素を削除する = ユーザー要望:
    //   転送後は転送元を消す）。
    provider.switchPage(originalIndex);
    provider.moveNodesToPage(copiedIds, newIndex);

    if (!mounted) return;
    _appSnack(
      context,
      SnackBar(
          content: Text(provider
              .t('copyTo.copiedMsg')
              .replaceAll('{n}', '${copiedIds.length}')
              .replaceAll('{name}', name))),
    );
    setState(() {
      _rangeSelectedIds.clear();
      _rangeSelectedDecorationIds.clear();
      _rangeSelectMode = false;
    });
  }

